Article 6 (Working Committee)
(1) A Nakdong River Basin Management Working Committee (hereinafter referred to as the "Working Committee") shall be established under the Committee to review and coordinate the following matters in practice:
1. Agenda items for consultation and coordination by the Committee;
2. Matters delegated by the Committee;
3. Other matters directed by the chairperson.
(2) The Working Committee shall consist of ten working members, including one chairperson. <Amended on September 7, 2021; December 28, 2021>
(3) The chairperson shall be the head of the Nakdong River Basin Environmental Office, and members shall be: <Amended on September 7, 2021; June 4, 2024>
1. Head of the Daegu Regional Environmental Office;
2. Deleted <December 28, 2021>;
3. Head of the Southern Regional Forest Service;
4. Relevant bureau directors of Busan, Daegu, Ulsan, Gyeongsangbuk-do, Gyeongsangnam-do, and Gangwon Special Self-Governing Province;
5. A person designated by the President of the Korea Water Resources Corporation from among its executives and employees under the Korea Water Resources Corporation Act.
(4) Article 3 (2) through (4) shall apply mutatis mutandis to meetings of the Working Committee.
